cofferdam-attester is the Self.xyz attester signing Worker for the
Cofferdam wallet stack. It holds the registered SelfAttester ECDSA
key as a Cloudflare-managed secret and signs bind messages over
Workers RPC. It is part of the Cofferdam identity rail described in:
  https://github.com/OffshoreSync/cofferdam-sdk/blob/main/IDENTITY_LAYER_DESIGN.md

